  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Lua use-after-free on SCRIPT FLUSH\n     - debian/patches/0019-CVE-2024-46981.patch: force a full Lua garbage\n       collection with lua_gc(server.lua, LUA_GCCOLLECT, 0) before\n       lua_close() in scriptingRelease() in src/scripting.c, so user data\n       is no longer freed while destructor callbacks may still use it.\n       Backport of upstream redis commit ca0a9ab82 (6.2.17); our\n       scriptingRelease() takes no async argument, so only the added\n       lua_gc() line is carried\n     - CVE-2024-46981",
